{"id":"punto","lemma":"punto","pos":"noun","rank":285,"glosses":["point (specific spot, location, or place)","point (unit of scoring)","point (full stop or period)"],"ipa":"/ˈpunto/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"puntos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/99/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-punto.wav","formAudio":{"puntos":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-GlyphEnjoyer-puntos.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ella tiene un buen punto.","en":"She's got a point.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444333"},{"text":"Esa ley tiene muchos puntos ambiguos.","en":"That law is full of ambiguities.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/930540"},{"text":"Está a punto de morir.","en":"He is about to die.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636907"},{"text":"¿Podrías por favor compendiar los puntos pertinentes?","en":"Could you please summarize the pertinent points?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804525"},{"text":"Estoy a punto de salir.","en":"I'm about to leave.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450377"}]}